() Tj T*
(## Testing and performance) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(`npm test` covers the deterministic price calculation and missing-pricing behavior. The booking) Tj T*
(route re-checks availability to prevent races at the application boundary. Production follow-up) Tj T*
(should add PostgreSQL transaction tests and Playwright coverage for the buyer-to-consultant journey.) Tj T*
(Static assets are small and images use responsive remote URLs; performance must be measured on the) Tj T*
(deployment target before making a 4G claim.) Tj T*
ET
